:true}},"body":"Mocking a `clone()` method on an interface appears to no longer be working with **Mockito 2.1.0**. The below code works fine with **Mockito 1.10.19** but throws an `IllegalAccessError` with **Mockito 2.1.0**:\n\n```\npublic interface CloneableInterface extends Cloneable {\n   CloneableInterface clone();\n}\n\npublic class CloneableInterfaceTest {\n\n   @Test\n   public void test() {      \n      CloneableInterface i = Mockito.mock(CloneableInterface.class);\n      Mockito.when(i.clone()).thenReturn(i); // Throws IllegalAccessError\n   }\n}\n```\n\nResult of running above test:\n\n```\njava.lang.IllegalAccessError: CloneableInterface$MockitoMock$833899610.clone()LCloneableInterface;\n```\n\nEnvironment: **JDK 1.8.0_102, JUnit 4.11, Mockito 2.1.0, Gradle 3.0, Windows 10**\n\nEDIT: Link to [SO post](http://stackoverflow.com/questions/39967723/mocking-interface-clone-method)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mockito/mockito/issues/688/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mockito/mockito/issues/688/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":991983426,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDk5MTk4MzQyNg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mockito/mockito/issues/events/991983426","actor":{"login":"SaiyiW","id":22788926,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzg4OTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22788926?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaiyiW","html_url":"https://github.com/SaiyiW","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaiyiW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaiyiW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaiyiW/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaiyiW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaiyiW/subscriptions","or